; Alice pays, then Bob does what the prohibition forbids. The whole trace is a
; violated trace of "alice MUST pay THEN bob MUST_NOT leak". When Alice pays, the
; term reaches the prohibition, whose outcome Done is immediate; that does not
; end the observation, and the term stays under observation to the end of the
; trace, like a prohibition at the top level. Its status is VIOLATED at entry 2,
; the leak (formal/core/CORE.md, decision 34); this is the reproduction of
; audit finding S-1. Two obligations in sequence are not discharged by one
; payment.
(scenario sequence_prohibition_violated
  (spec "examples/core/core_sequence.triel")
  (entry "2026-06-01T09:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T10:00:00Z" (act alice pay must)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T11:00:00Z" (act bob leak must_not)
    (data)))
